            "heading": "",
            "width": "narrow",
            "content": "<h3>Bookings</h3><p>A booking is confirmed when we receive the advance payment and send a confirmation. Prices are subject to availability and may change until confirmation.</p><h3>Payments</h3><p>A 25% advance confirms the booking; the balance is due 21 days before departure.</p><h3>Changes</h3><p>Hotel or route changes after confirmation may cost extra. We are not responsible for delays caused by weather, strikes or other events beyond our control.</p>"
          }
